{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_absin_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_absin_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "向死寻生",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_absin_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "52040b3565eace8b1c88f0861e8ae87ad2facda86631a2ba843af8fcae2a416b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "地下废墟"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......这里是罗德岛干员......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......重复，这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员......早露。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "约两个小时三十分钟前，我们于乌萨斯边境天灾疏散任务中与队伍失散，陷入一处塌方形成的地下空洞......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......目前暂时没有人员伤亡。最后的位置坐标......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "收到请回复。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "不行，还是联络不上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "也许我得再换个位置——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "——你怎么站起来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "你应该坐下来好好休息，你的腿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "娜塔莉娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你离开了三十分钟，有什么发现吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......很遗憾，没有能帮助我们离开这里的发现呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不过你说的没错，里面的确是一个自然形成的溶洞，但透光处位于更深处的正上方，而不是直线尽头。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "无法沿着洞穴离开，头顶的透光处又过高，没有外部援助，我们很难出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "看来和这里的情况差不多。我知道了，谢谢你的确认。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不用谢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不如说，反而是我应该谢谢你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "对了，苦艾小姐，你感觉好些了吗？你的伤口怎么样了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我在后勤部门的时候，学习过有限条件下的急救措施，可以再帮你检查一下止血情况，然后换药。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "不用......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不要急着拒绝我。你为了救我受伤，又带着我避开了后续的余震。这都是我应该做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......东侧已经疏散完毕，确认没有居民了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "山脚的最后一户也已经安全转移。时间不够了，我们需要尽快撤离，否则天灾——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "——当心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "苦艾小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......抓住我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "嘶......啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "腿部传来的剧痛使苦艾的声音变得扭曲。但她很快将痛呼压低，隐忍不发，强行将注意力转移到周围。\n在这陡至的黑暗中，她一无所获。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......看不清。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "之后肯定还有余震，得快点转移位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "呃——光棒不在我这里。早......娜塔莉娅！你能听见我说话吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "娜塔莉娅？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她伸出手去，交握的掌心仍然温热，所幸两人并未因坠落而彻底分散开来。\n但此刻另一只手的主人却毫无回音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......昏迷了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "有血腥味，黏稠......她头上好像也出血了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "头部出血......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "得先转移位置，最好有些光线才能看清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "（轻敲断壁）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "断壁横梁带出一阵空洞的回响，驱散头脑中的混沌。闭眼后再睁眼，她的视野逐渐清晰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......来吧，来吧。至少给我一个更安全的方向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "苦艾搀扶起昏迷的同伴，向隐约有光的地方挪去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我只是做了我应该做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "换了罗德岛的其他任何人，他们也都会这样做。带着同伴，找到结构更稳定的地下空间，争取救援时间......固定流程而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "而且就像你头上的伤一样，我的腿伤也不严重，都是外伤，已经止血，也没有骨头需要掰正，急救派不上用场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你不用太在意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "那......通讯器？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "还是无法联络外界。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "而且因为里面储存的能源剩得不多，我们不能一直保持开机状态，等待信号被捕捉，只能间隔一段时间再尝试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "那我现在还能做些什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "目前暂时只能先等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你想问什么，可以直接问。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "有这么明显吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "其实我是想问我们最后疏散的、住在山脚下的那对母子，他们是不是真的安全撤离了？因为地震来得很突然......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "而且，如果真的联络不上外界，到时候我们该怎么办呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "第一，在和你会合之前，我确认过那对母子已经疏散到安全地带。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "第二，如果主动联络失败，等他们清点人数时发现我们缺席，也会派人出来寻找的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "这些都在常规流程中，就像我之前救你一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "你总是这么可靠吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "你很可靠，好像没有什么困境能击溃你。现在如果只有我一个人在这里，我肯定不知道该怎么办了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "不，你知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "你说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "在切尔诺伯格——在那种地方，当事故发生，如果你真的不知道应该做什么，又怎么能从那儿活着离开呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "更不要说现在了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "你怎么知道——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "啊，我总是忘记你也是从切城......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "是呀。为了活下去，我做过一些事，但也得到了许多帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "所以我更不明白之前你为什么要选择折返。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你明明可以安全离开，却选择回来和我们一起继续疏散不愿离开的村民。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "没有救援任务经验的干员就该在天灾来临前随大部队一起返回，而不是留下来。万一我之前没能救下你，或者这次我们真的没能出去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "那你之前那些为了活下来而做的努力就全都白费了，帮助过你的人，他们的努力也都白费了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "道理是这样，没错。可如果每次我都不选择留下，那我永远都会是那个没有经验的新人，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "永远原地踏步，永远帮助不了更多的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我也想像你们一样，能做更多......这也是为什么我选择从后勤转到前线来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......这些理由不能改变你在没有足够能力的前提下，主动选择了“危险”这件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你其实并不把自己的性命当成什么重要的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "（小声）真不知道，那些帮过你，甚至为此丢了性命的人......会怎么想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "可你有话没有说完。为什么不说完呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "没什么，这本来也不关我的事，是我多话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "已经间隔一段时间了，我换个位置，调整一下通讯器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露，重复，这里是罗德岛干员......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "也许再举高一些？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我正在尝试——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断续的声音",
      "text": "——探测仪——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断续的声音",
      "text": "——嗞——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "——？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "喂？这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露！我们于乌萨斯边境天灾疏散任务中与队伍失散，陷入一处塌方形成的地下空洞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我们最后的位置坐标——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断续的声音",
      "text": "——嗞——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "喂？请问能听到吗？我们最后的坐标是61.700.20.450——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......喂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "该死，好不容易......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "但既然能收到通讯，就说明这附近有其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "让我拿着通讯器去洞穴里试试吧，说不定在透光处下面，通讯状况会更好呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "洞穴......那我们一起过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "可是你的伤？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我说过了，没有问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "在这种情况下，我们本来就更应该一起行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "那我来搀着你吧，总能节省一些力气......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "苦艾轻轻摇头，避过了那只向她伸来的手。\n眼前人的力气足够拎起巨大的攻城器械，自然也足够搀扶一位体重偏轻的伤者。\n在她的帮助下前进应该是此刻最合适的选择，可不知为何，苦艾就是不愿这样做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "啊，好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "那我们就，走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......在这边......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "先前我沿着边缘寻找，想看看有没有通道的时候，发现了这个地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "瞧，一个不大不小的石墩，站上去虽然能离头顶的光源更近一点，但对触摸到透光处来说还差得远。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "总之请稍等，等我爬上去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你小心——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "——好了！请把通讯器递给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......坐标记住了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "记住了，很清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不过......咦？这个要在哪里打开呢？好像和之前我用过的通讯器有点不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......抱歉，这是我自己改装的通讯器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "频段我已经调好了，你按下侧面的长方形按钮开机。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "喂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐约的声音",
      "text": "——嗞——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "有声音！这算不算？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "信号被接收了，和刚才一样，按照我教给你的汇报就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "好、好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露，我们于乌萨斯边境天灾疏散任务中与队伍失散，陷入一处塌方形成的地下空洞......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "最后位置坐标为61.700.20.450。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "重复，最后位置坐标为——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "——喂？——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "能听到吗？这里是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "——天灾信使——喂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "回复说能听到，然后重复坐标。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我们能听到！这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露，我们需要支援，最后位置坐标为61.700.20.450！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "——收到——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "请在原地——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "——等——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我——抱歉，我没听清他最后说了什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "没关系。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "只要成功传回了坐标，就成功了一半。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "现在，我们就先回原来的地方吧。那里结构相对稳定，之前两次余震都没有受到多少影响，更安全，也更适合等待救援。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "通讯又中断了，天灾应该还没有完全过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "现在最重要的，是在救援人员到达之前，保证自己的安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "按时间来说应该就快到了，我在最开始停留的地方做了记号。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你看见一块红色的布料了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我没有看见。不过我这里还有两根光棒，用它们来照明吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "给我一根。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "不，还是先留着吧。我们不知道救援人员具体的到达时间，不要把物资提前用光了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "而且我记得应该就在这附近......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "什么......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "——是余震！该死——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "苦艾小姐，你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "别过来！蹲下，然后用手抱住头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "照我说的做！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "咳咳——咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "坍塌不严重，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "光源被挡住了，钢管和横梁应该没有继续断裂——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "娜塔莉娅？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "娜塔莉娅，你怎么样了？能听见我说话吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "回答她的只有灰尘簌簌落下的动静，和逐渐沉重的呼吸声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "嘿、嘿，我听见了。来，把手给我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "哦，你拿着光棒，正好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......呜......啊......！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "娜塔莉娅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "天哪，你抖得厉害，你伤到哪里了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我能帮你——呃——救援人员就快到了，你再坚持一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "——杀了我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "直接杀了我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......你说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "是因为——是因为太痛了吗？你为什么会这样说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我请求您......帮帮我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我得知道你伤到哪里才能帮忙，但你一直在躲开我，这样我没有办法——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "娜塔莉娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你怎么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "呜、呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我......不......不——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我请求您，我请求您......不要把我留在这里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我不会把你留在这里，我不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "所以，告诉我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "如果你什么也不告诉我，那我要怎么帮你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我看不清。我看不见！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我什么也看不见......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......你看不见？难道你的眼睛受伤了？还是头部受伤，淤血压迫了神经？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "请你保持不动，我得看看——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "眼睛看上去没有聚焦，头上似乎没有新的伤口......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你还有哪里受伤了吗？是什么让你痛成这样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "慢一点，尽量清晰地告诉我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不行......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "不行？为什么不行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "瞧瞧，我都在说些什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "您还是杀了我吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......杀了我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你究竟为什么一直要说这种话？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我们先前——我们先前在这里说过的那些，都是不存在的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你说你想活下来，想帮助更多的人，那也都只是冠冕堂皇的假话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "——是啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......！什——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "所以您杀了我吧！就像您放了那把火一样杀了我吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "与其让我这样苟活，倒不如令我痛快地死去，就像我害死的那些人，他们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "他们不会要我活着。您也不需要我活着，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "只需要用您的那柄斧子，对着这里来上一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "就像这样，很快的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我只有这一个请求......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "这也不可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我不知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我不知道你究竟是怎么了，但我听见了你说的话。而我不能对这些话坐视不理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "因为你的命不是你一个人的，就像我的也不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我们的命属于那些被永远留下的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......求你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "死在切城的人太多了。你有没有读过事后的报告？我读过，就算我怎么也数不清遇难者名单上那些小小的名字，也还是一遍遍地去数......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我想找到瓦列里叔叔的名字，找到......找到我父亲的名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "他去过彼得海姆，然后把命丢在了那儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我不知道那里当时究竟发生过什么，我只能猜测，然后不断地观察你们这些从彼得海姆来的幸存者，试图得到一个答案，关于......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......谁在说......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "关于我父亲的牺牲究竟换来了什么，在你们身上，究竟有什么值得他牺牲的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我想知道，我必须知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "可是我没有答案！我一直都没有找到——所以我本来都打算不去想了，直到你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "直到你突然从后勤转到前线，出现在这样的任务里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我以为你向前走了。你有吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你并没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "杀了我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "别说了！我不会杀你！既然做出了选择，那你凭什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你凭什么不好好珍惜自己的生命？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......求你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "如果你实在想死，可以。等我们从这里出去，等到没人注意的时候，你有无数种方法——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "杀了我吧，索尼娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "——随便你......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "就只是，杀了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不要、不要让我活着留在这里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "这里，什么也没有啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "呜......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......“索尼娅”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "这不是我的名字，你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你认为自己现在在哪儿？在切城吗？在彼得海姆吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "如果你......并没有从创伤中恢复，又为什么要申请成为前线干员，为什么要以身涉险？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你难道预料不到......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "这样狼狈的时刻吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......我在哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "学校的食堂......是这样的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不、我记不清——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你已经不在切城了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "那我在哪儿？你又是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你现在正在地下某处，我是罗德岛干员苦艾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "地下。为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......因为你想救更多的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "而现在，我们要找到走出去的方法。如果你能听见我说话，就闭上眼睛，跟着我，深呼吸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "让我带你走出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "呼——呃——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "咳——咳咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "你怎么样了？你感觉还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "呃、苦艾小姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我这是......怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......我怎么哭了？真不好意思......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "没什么，只是耽误了一些时间。我们得再试试联络外界了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露，最后位置坐标为61.700.20.450。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "重复，这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "咦？好像有频段接入了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂——喂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这里是罗德岛灾后搜救小队，请直接报上坐标——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......接上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "最后位置坐标为61.700.20.450，建议搜寻西侧塌陷地块。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我们这里有两个人，状态......尚可。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "娜......早露，请按照之前我说的节奏敲响你身边的钢管。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "两轻一重......是这样吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "坐标是之前收到过的那个，求救信号......红外探测仪显示——好、好近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "——喂？还能听到吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "如果能听见，就用刚才的频率敲击钢管，回应我们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "搜救队伍到了。\n苦艾向着声音传来的上方抬起头，早露则再次敲响身边最近的钢管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有人！下面有人！就在我们收到的坐标附近，应该就是她们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "稍等，我们马上开展救援，请待在原地，不要随意移动......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "收到请敲一下钢管！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "（敲一下钢管）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "好的，好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "请稍等——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "你身上有伤，一会儿你先上去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "我的身体状况更好一些，没问题的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尽管早就知道劫后余生的喜悦并不如书本中描述的那样强烈，苦艾还是感到一阵恍然。\n在云朵仿若火焰一样铺开的天空之下，她深深地、像呼吸一样感受着这阵转瞬即逝的情绪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "......干员苦艾状态确认，初步判断为轻伤，已成功获救。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "请先在一旁休息，不要剧烈运动，等干员早露也被营救上来之后，我会马上帮你重新处理小腿伤口——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "——干员苦艾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "我来帮忙吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "什么？你还是别动——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......咦？苦艾小姐，你的伤——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "没什么要紧的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "把手给我吧，我会拉你上来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苦艾",
      "text": "干员早露。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
